        "instructionsHtml": "<p>Listen and answer questions 1–10.</p>",
        "groups": [
          {
            "id": "part-1-group-1",
            "type": "completion",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 1–10</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the form below. Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div class=\"notes-title\"><strong>AA Property Rentals</strong></div><ul><li>Where property required: Birmingham</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Personal details</p><ul><li>Name: Kevin Walker</li><li>Address: {{1}} Road, West Bromwich</li><li>Phone: {{2}}</li><li>Occupation: {{3}}</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Details of property wanted</p><ul><li>A two-bedroom {{4}} apartment to rent</li><li>Maximum rent: £650 a month</li><li>The bedrooms must be {{5}}</li><li>Date required: {{6}}</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\"><strong>If possible, the apartment should:</strong></p><ul><li>have a {{7}} or a {{8}}</li><li>be near a {{9}}</li><li>have a large {{10}}</li></ul></div>",
            "maxWords": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "number": 2,
        "title": "Part 2",
        "instructionsHtml": "<p>Listen and answer questions 11–20.</p>",
        "groups": [
          {
            "id": "part-2-group-1",
            "type": "mcq",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 11–16</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 11,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;Compared to last year's storm, this year",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "more houses in the area were affected."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "the water levels rose much higher."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "there was more severe damage to trees."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 12,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;According to the speaker, what should you do if your home has been flooded?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "switch off the electricity"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "try to drain the water"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "wait for a few days"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 13,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What does the speaker advise residents to do with their garden waste?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "put it in a special bin"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "take it to the council rubbish centre"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "pile it next to the road"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 14,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;People who cannot cook food should",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "pick up vouchers from the council office."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "get a meal in the community centre."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "arrange for food to be brought to their home."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 15,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;People who want to help out are asked to",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "contact their local council office."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "come to the community centre in the morning."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "bring their tools to the council office."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 16,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What problem should residents report to the council?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "an increased number of mosquitoes"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "native animals found in unusual places"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "contaminated water"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "part-2-group-2",
            "type": "matching",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 17–20</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
